# No line-ending conversion, anywhere.
#
# This is not a style preference. tools/build_release.py verifies that every entry in
# the built PBO is byte-identical to its source file, and that a rebuild reproduces a
# known release exactly (v0.4.1 reproduces as
# sha256 4fd51ef648a4e2ce4cb705edebcd4ddc4fc52cfb11e60c5be172d6a5fe64f9a3).
#
# If git rewrote LF to CRLF on checkout, every .sqf would gain a byte per line, the
# PBO built from a fresh clone would differ from the one built here, and both the
# byte-identity check and the reproducibility guarantee would fail. Arma also reads
# these files verbatim.
* -text

# Binary, never diffed or converted.
*.pbo binary
*.bin binary
*.sqfc binary
*.zip binary
*.paa binary
